#: ../main_window.rst:377
msgid "**Typical workflow:**"
msgstr "**সাধারণ ওয়ার্কফ্লো:**"

#: ../main_window.rst:379
msgid "Arrange your docks exactly how you like them."
msgstr "আপনার ডকগুলো ঠিক যেমন চান তেমন সাজান।"

#: ../main_window.rst:380
msgid ""
"Open :guilabel:`View → My Views → Save Current View As...` and enter a name "
"(e.g. *\"Audio Mix\"*)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`View → My Views → Save Current View As...` খুলুন এবং একটি নাম দিন"
" (যেমন *\"Audio Mix\"*)।"

#: ../main_window.rst:381
msgid ""
"Later, open :guilabel:`View → My Views` and click the view name to restore "
